  "VISUAL_NOVEL_OKAY_ILL_TRY_THAT_OUT": "okay.. nnt aku cuba",
  "VISUAL_NOVEL_WHATS_OTHER_WORLD": "apa benda Other World tu?",
  "VISUAL_NOVEL_YOU_GOTTA_BE_JOKING_YOU_DONT_REMEMBER_ITS_THE_GAME_WE_PLAYED_WHEN_WE_WERE_KIDS_ARE_YOU_SURE_THIS_IS_LIZ": "biar betul! tu kan game yg kita main masa kecik kita dulu. kau pasti ke ni liz?",
  "VISUAL_NOVEL_YES_IM_SURE_HOW_DO_I_GET_IN": "ya... aku pasti. mcm mana aku nak masuk?",
  "VISUAL_NOVEL_JUST_TO_MAKE_SURE_YOU_ARE_WHO_YOU_SAY_YOU_ARE_CAN_YOU_TELL_ME_THE_ORDER_OF_THE_FOUR_EVENTS_DURING_OUR_FINAL_RITUAL": "saya nak pastikan ko ni mmg org yg kau ckp... blh ko bgtau turutan empat acara masa ritual terakhir kita",
  "VISUAL_NOVEL_ILL_TRY_TO_REMEMBER": "aku cuba ingat balik",
  "VISUAL_NOVEL_I_DONT_REMEMBER": "aku tak ingat",
  "VISUAL_NOVEL_THAT_S_OKAY_TAKE_YOUR_TIME": "takpe, ambillah masa",
