  "VISUAL_NOVEL_WE_FOUGHT_THE_LOST_BOYS": "kita lawan the lost boys",
  "VISUAL_NOVEL_WE_RESPECTED_THE_FOUR_FALLEN": "kita beri penghormatan kpd empat orang yg gugur",
